WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.480
Jobs: every on-site job with search and status; each with a checklist, before/after photos, parts, the customer's sign-off and payment.

2
00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:18.710
Open a job; the technician fills the checklist, photos and "Customer sign-off" from their own link.

3
00:00:19.258 --> 00:00:25.680
Add parts under "Parts & materials"; then "Request payment" or "Record cash".

4
00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:32.570
If something is left, create a "Follow-up"; for regular service, click "Make recurring".

5
00:00:33.118 --> 00:00:40.350
A job can't close without a required after-photo or sign-off; remind technicians to finish before leaving.
